{
  "_comment": [
    "The SHARED STRUCTURE CATALOG for the persona test sets.",
    "",
    "Every persona realises EVERY structure in its own words and its own voice.",
    "A structure fixes the GRAMMAR OF THE ASK (how many asks, which action, which",
    "slots are present) and therefore the ground truth; a persona fixes the WORDS",
    "and the PHRASING HABIT. That separation is the experiment: if engine quality",
    "varies across personas on a structure-matched slice, the variance can only be",
    "vocabulary + phrasing, because the structural composition is identical.",
    "",
    "`tokens` is the exact placeholder set every persona's template for this",
    "structure must use (order free, no extras, none missing) — gen_personas.py",
    "fails the build otherwise. That is what keeps the slot ground truth",
    "shape-identical across personas.",
    "",
    "`op_gold` / `kind_gold` are the ModelRouter classifier golds. null means the",
    "row has no single correct answer for that classifier (a cross-action compound",
    "is neither 'new' nor 'remove'), and it is EXCLUDED from that classifier's",
    "score rather than guessed at. Atomicity gold is always `atomic`."
  ],
